61
00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.130
We were so lucky to have her.

62
00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:54.870
You have probably seen her many times on such shows as Mom, Friends, Seinfeld, All-American Girl, The Hughleys, Night Court, Six Feet Under, Desperate Housewives, King of the Hill,

63
00:02:54.870 --> 00:03:02.070
Third Rock from the Sun, The Sarah Silverman Program, and we have our very own crossover connection here.

64
00:03:02.510 --> 00:03:08.870
Angela Kinsey, both you and Amy Hill have appeared on the show Life in Pieces.

65
00:03:09.130 --> 00:03:10.050
We did.

66
00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:11.750
Amy was the principal.

67
00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:15.250
And I played Ruth, who worked at a pet adoption booth.

68
00:03:15.390 --> 00:03:16.470
I was just in one episode.

69
00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:16.930
Okay.

70
00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:21.090
Amy is an amazing character actress.

71
00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:22.730
She's just a legend.

72
00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:24.430
Her filmography is huge.

73
00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:28.910
And I want you guys to know there's a fantastic interview with her by the A.V.

74
00:03:29.030 --> 00:03:29.350
Club.

75
